        delimited list commits every term it contains in one go. A term that names an existing item selects that item,
        and &mdash; with <b>Dynamic</b> enabled &mdash; a term that names none becomes a new item, so a list copied out
        of a spreadsheet or an e-mail turns into a selection without being retyped item by item. A term the selection
